   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Dogs can hear frequencies of up to <span data-math=\"45\\,\\text{kHz}\">45\\,\\text{kHz}</span>. What is the wavelength of a sound wave with this frequency traveling in air at <span data-math=\"0^{\\circ}\\text{C}\">0^{\\circ}\\text{C}</span>?",
